<title>UK: Timah at 14 in London at 0847 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 14 in London at 0847 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $14 per GDR in London on Friday at around 0847 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $14 and a high of $14.125.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Thursday was $14.125.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
